  "description": "DocxTemplater is a powerful C# library for generating DOCX documents from customizable templates.\n\t\t\tIt enables seamless data binding to templates, making document creation accessible even for non-programmers.\n\t\t\tKey features include placeholder replacement, loops, conditional blocks, dynamic tables, Markdown and HTML support,\n\t\t\tand image embedding. Optional packages extend functionality with advanced image handling, Markdown support and\n\t\t\ttext / HTML templates (e.g. e-mails) with the same syntax, making DocxTemplater an ideal tool for automating complex document workflows.",
